WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.670
- Q, how does it feel to be
back on the Universal lot?

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:04.023
- Oh horrifying,

00:00:04.023 --> 00:00:07.610
I had PTSD walking in here.

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:10.780
The setup here that she's referring to

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:11.840
is the way our show works.

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:12.673
I don't know if-

00:00:12.673 --> 00:00:13.506
Has anybody seen it?

00:00:13.506 --> 00:00:14.404
Give me a big applause.

00:00:14.404 --> 00:00:15.237
(applause and cheers)

00:00:15.237 --> 00:00:16.287
All right, great.

00:00:16.287 --> 00:00:18.620
- All right, before you continue

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:19.890
we'll start here, we'll go left,

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:20.760
we'll make our way to the front.

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:22.690
Give one reason why you like the show, go.

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:24.663
- [Q] We got time, we
got time, we got time.

00:00:25.838 --> 00:00:28.360
- It's a ten hour show, we're fine.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:29.650
- [Q] Catch it online, the
rest of this interview,

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:30.550
me describing the show.

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:32.780
It's just, we go out in public

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:33.780
and we mess around with each other

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:34.808
and we tell, you know

00:00:34.808 --> 00:00:35.641
- I know

00:00:35.641 --> 00:00:36.474
- And we tell each other what to do

00:00:36.474 --> 00:00:38.560
and if you don't do it at
the end of the episode,

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:39.523
you get punishment.

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:43.288
- So go back for the Universal tram story,

00:00:43.288 --> 00:00:44.799
'cause I know what it
is but they don't know

00:00:44.799 --> 00:00:45.650
what your Universal story is.

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:47.730
- So here at Universal they
have the famous tram ride

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:49.890
that goes around the whole sets and tours.

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:50.723
- This is awesome

00:00:50.723 --> 00:00:52.380
- My punishment, it wasn't awesome,

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:53.360
it wasn't awesome at all!

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:56.670
- [Kelly] Y'all are such,
words I can't say on daytime

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:58.810
- So the way that the tram
works is it's like the subway

00:00:58.810 --> 00:01:00.890
where if an emergency happens
someone drops their cellphone,

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:02.810
they can pull the thing, stop the ride.

00:01:02.810 --> 00:01:04.870
So what they made me do is stop the ride

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:06.800
seven, eight times in an hour.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:08.490
And the first time people are forgiving,

00:01:08.490 --> 00:01:11.000
they're like "Oh poor guy,
he dropped his cellphone".

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:12.767
But then I had to stop
the ride and be like

00:01:12.767 --> 00:01:14.820
"Uh could you repeat that?"

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:18.090
And then, by the seventh
time that I pulled that,

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:20.097
people were looking at
me in the eye and be like

00:01:20.097 --> 00:01:22.680
"When we get off this
ride, I'm gonna find you,

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:23.930
and I'm gonna kill you".

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:26.110
And that's an actual quote
that somebody said to me

00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:28.046
on the Universal tram, it was horrible.

00:01:28.046 --> 00:01:28.879
(applause)

00:01:28.879 --> 00:01:29.712
It was horrible.

00:01:29.712 --> 00:01:30.910
- [Joe] Thank you, thank you.

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:35.400
- For us though, it was a hoot.

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.940
- You should take the tour
if you haven't it's so great.

00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:40.940
- Like a four-year-old girl was
giving me the middle finger.

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:43.340
It was bad, it was really bad.

00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:44.760
- All right, so Joe and Murray,

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:46.460
it's my favorite I love your show.

